{%- comment -%}
  Renders a single colour swatch as a button that selects its variant.

  @param value - the product option value
  @param is_available - whether any variant in this colour is currently in stock
  @param product - the product, used to resolve this colour's variant
  @param color_position - which option index holds the colour

  Usage: {% render 'product-swatch', value: value, is_available: true, product: product, color_position: 1 %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  comment
    The chip is a flat colour, never a photograph: the value's own swatch colour
    where the merchant has set one, otherwise its name read as a CSS colour,
    since black, white, navy, grey and the rest are colour keywords already. A
    name that is neither leaves the neutral colour underneath standing. The
    variant's media still rides along in the data attributes -- that is what the
    click swaps the card to.
  endcomment
  assign swatch_color = value.swatch.color
  if swatch_color == blank
    assign swatch_color = value | append: '' | downcase | strip | replace: ' ', ''
  endif

  assign swatch_title = value
  unless is_available
    assign swatch_title = value | append: ' — sold out'
  endunless

  comment
    Resolve this colour to a real variant: prefer one that is in stock, otherwise
    fall back to the first variant wearing this colour.
  endcomment
  assign match_variant = null
  for product_variant in product.variants
    if color_position == 1
      assign variant_color = product_variant.option1
    elsif color_position == 2
      assign variant_color = product_variant.option2
    else
      assign variant_color = product_variant.option3
    endif
    if variant_color == value
      unless match_variant
        assign match_variant = product_variant
      endunless
      if product_variant.available
        assign match_variant = product_variant
        break
      endif
    endif
  endfor

  assign variant_media = match_variant.featured_media
-%}
<button
  type="button"
  class="product-card__swatch"
  data-swatch
  title="{{ swatch_title | escape }}"
  aria-label="{{ swatch_title | escape }}"
  aria-pressed="false"
  data-available="{% if is_available %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
  {%- if match_variant %} data-variant-id="{{ match_variant.id }}"{% endif -%}
  {%- if variant_media %}
    data-src="{{ variant_media | image_url: width: 700 }}"
    data-srcset="{{ variant_media | image_url: width: 400 }} 400w, {{ variant_media | image_url: width: 700 }} 700w, {{ variant_media | image_url: width: 1000 }} 1000w"
    data-bleed="{{ variant_media | image_url: width: 400 }}"
    data-alt="{{ variant_media.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
  {% endif -%}
  style="background-color: #cfcbc4; background-color: {{ swatch_color | escape }};"
></button>
